        "subject": "={{ $json.alert_status }} - {{ $json.pond_id }}",
        "html": "=\n<h2>Farm Operations Alert</h2>\n\n<p>A pond measurement requires attention.</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><b>Pond ID</b></td>\n    <td>{{ $json.pond_id }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><b>Record Date</b></td>\n    <td>{{ $json.record_date }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><b>Temperature</b></td>\n    <td>{{ $json.temperature_c }} °C</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><b>Dissolved Oxygen</b></td>\n    <td>{{ $json.dissolved_oxygen_mg_l }} mg/L</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><b>Feed Quantity</b></td>\n    <td>{{ $json.feed_kg }} kg</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><b>Alert</b></td>\n    <td>{{ $json.alert_status }}</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p>Please inspect the pond and verify the measurements.</p>\n<p><i>Automated notification from Farm Operations Workflow Automation.</i></p>\n",
